                            The Dungeons of Doom
                           ======================
                   by Boudewijn Wayers (dedos4@win.tue.nl)


This file describes all branches and special levels in the Dungeons of Doom.
It is divided in several parts, sorted by branch. Per branch, the various
special levels are described in the order in which they are usually
encoutered.

The Dungeons of Doom (D) are 25 to 30 levels deep. There are several special
levels in this main dungeon. Their location is indicated in the following
table.

Also in this table, you'll see where to find the so called branches, leading
away from the Dungeons of Doom. These branches may have branches or special
levels themselves, which are named when the branch in question is described
later on. In this document, branches are double underlined while levels are
single underlined.                       =================
