                                 The Castle
                                ~~~~~~~~~~~~
This is the stronghold level. There are several ways to enter it: opening
the drawbridge (for example, with a wand of opening, a knock spell, or by
playing the appropriate tune), or entering via the back entry (this supposes
posession of a ring of levitation, boots of water walking, etc.). Note: if
you don't play the right tune, you get indications like in the MasterMind
game.

To motivate the player, there are 4 storerooms (armour, weapons, food and
gems) and a wand of wishing in one of the 4 towers. Left and right of the
castle is a small maze.

