                              The Gnomish Mines
                             ===================

The Gnomish Mines are just as the name implies: large caves filled with
gnomes and some dwarves, some of the latter still busy mining.

                               The Mines' Town
                              ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
Also known as the Shopping Mall, the Gnomish Mines' Town is a level
containing mainly a lot of buildings. The larger room depicted has a door or
gap at both the right and left side, and is centered on the screen. There
are ordinary rooms on both sides, which contain the up and down staircases.
There can be various shops: a random one in room A (90% chance), a tool shop
in room B (90%), a food shop in room C (90%), and a candle shop in room D
(always). Also, there is always a temple in room E with a randomly aligned
priest.

