                                  Gehennom
                                 ==========

Now re-worked for NetHack 3.1, hell is much less boring than it used to be.
Gehennom is no longer considered "hellish" in its entirety (that is: fire
resistance is no longer a condition for survival in it). However, Gehennom,
and the special levels in it in particular, is abundant with fire traps. As
a result, fire resistance is still a prudent survival strategy in Gehennom.
Gehennom (G) is 25 to 30 levels deep. All levels, if not specified
otherwise, are maze levels. That is, the maps depicted here are centered and
any space left around it is a maze. There are only one-way stairs (there are
no stairs down).

